width=\"4.318ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1908.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1505,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) - II (Tetrahedral)</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct matching is option B:</p>\n\n<p><b>Option B: A-III, B-I, C-IV, D-II</b></p>"}]}